arch\u001b[37Gform working. I could also ship it a\u001b[75Gi\u001b[77Gitial cont\u001b[88Gnt inside \u001b[99Ghe si\u001b[105Ge\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bpackage so it comes up\u001b[26Go\u001b[28G a fres\u001b[37Ginstall. Do you\u001b[53Gwant me t\u001b[64Gdo either?\u001b[75G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GBrewed for 21s · done 8:54 AM\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[38;2;255;255;255m What do you suggest I do first, and why?\u001b[39m                                                               \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mStart\u001b[9Gwith\u001b[14Gthe\u001b[18Gpage\u001b[23Gtree,\u001b[29Gand\u001b[33Gship\u001b[38Git\u001b[41Gwith\u001b[46Gthe\u001b[50Gsite\u001b[55Gpackage\u001b[63Gas\u001b[66Ginitial\u001b[74Gcontent\u001b[82Grather\u001b[89Gthan\u001b[94Gclicking\u001b[103Git\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3Gtoge\u001b[8Gher in the backend.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mWhy the page tree first\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[22m- \u001b[1mEverything\u001b[16Gels\u001b[21Gdepends on it.\u001b[36G\u001b[22mThe\u001b[40Gmenus,\u001b[47Gthe\u001b[51Gthree\u001b[57Gsite\u001b[62Gsettings\u001b[71G(service\u001b[80Gmenu,\u001b[86Gfooter\u001b[93Gmenu,\u001b[99Gsearch\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gpage), the sub-navigation on Land rates and the br\u001b[56Gadcrumb all need real pag\u001b[82Gs. The s\u001b[91Gttings ev\u001b[101Gn need\u001b[31;1H\u001b[29;3H\u001b[?25h"]
