search\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gpage), the sub-navigation on Land rates and the br\u001b[56Gadcrumb all need real pag\u001b[82Gs. The s\u001b[91Gttings ev\u001b[101Gn need\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Btheir pag\u001b[16GIDs, wh\u001b[24Gch d\u001b[30G't exist\u001b[39Gye\u001b[42G.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mIt's the fastest visible result.\u001b[22m With no\u001b[46Gnew\u001b[50Gcode,\u001b[56Gthe\u001b[60Gmain\u001b[65Gmenu\u001b[70Gfills\u001b[76Gin,\u001b[80Gthe\u001b[84Gfooter's\u001b[93G\"Information\"\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gcolumn and the service links show up,\u001b[43Gthe search form appears, and you\u001b[76Gcan\u001b[80Gc\u001b[83Gck all five layouts \u001b[105G\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Breal pages.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mIt tests the site package you just built.\u001b[47G\u001b[22mIf\u001b[50Ga\u001b[52Glayout\u001b[59Gor\u001b[62Gmenu\u001b[67Gis\u001b[70Gwrong,\u001b[77Gyou'll\u001b[84Gsee\u001b[88Git\u001b[91Gnow,\u001b[96Gbefore\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gcontent elements are layered on top.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mWhy as initial content in the package\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[22mYour commits are stages (\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mStage 00\u001b[39m to \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mStage 03\u001b[39m),\u001b[51Gso\u001b[54Gthis\u001b[59Glooks\u001b[65Glike\u001b[70Ga\u001b[72Gdemo\u001b[77Gthat\u001b[82Ghas\u001b[86Gto\u001b[89Gcome\u001b[94Gup\u001b[97Gthe\u001b[101Gsame\u001b[31;1H\u001b[29;3H\u001b[?25h"]
