[144.885894, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3G-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mIt tests the site package you just built.\u001b[47G\u001b[22mIf a lay\u001b[56Gut\u001b[59Gor menu is wrong, you'll see it now, before\u001b[103G\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bcontent \u001b[14Glements\u001b[22Gare\u001b[26Glayered\u001b[34Gon\u001b[37Gtop.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mWhy as initial content in the package\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BYour\u001b[8Gcommits\u001b[16Gare\u001b[20Gstages\u001b[27G(\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mStage 00\u001b[37G\u001b[39mto\u001b[40G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mStage 03\u001b[39m),\u001b[51Gso\u001b[54Gthis\u001b[59Glooks\u001b[65Glike\u001b[70Ga\u001b[72Gdemo\u001b[77Gthat\u001b[82Ghas\u001b[86Gto\u001b[89Gcome\u001b[94Gup\u001b[97Gthe\u001b[101Gsame\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bway on a fresh install. If the pages exist\u001b[46Gonly\u001b[51Gin\u001b[54Gyour\u001b[59Glocal\u001b[65Gdatabase,\u001b[75Gthe\u001b[79Gnext\u001b[84Gstage\u001b[90Gcan't\u001b[96Gbe\u001b[99Grebuilt\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bfrom\u001b[8Gthe repository. If\u001b[27Gthey ship\u001b[37Gas\u001b[40Ginitial conten\u001b[55G \u001b[57Gn\u001b[59G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mmtosafi_sitepackage\u001b[39m, a\u001b[82Gfresh install gets\u001b[101Gthe\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bs\u001b[5Gme page tree, layouts\u001b[27Gand s\u001b[33Gtting\u001b[41Gvery\u001b[46Gtime.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mAfter that, in this order\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B1.\u001b[6G\u001b[1mThe home page content elements:\u001b[38G\u001b[22mslider,\u001b[46Gservice\u001b[54Gtiles,\u001b[61Gnews\u001b[66Gand\u001b[70Gevents\u001b[77Gteasers.\u001b[86GThese\u001b[92Gare\u001b[96Gthe\u001b[100Gmost\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B   visible part of the design\u001b[33Gand\u001b[37Gneed\u001b[42Gthe\u001b[46Gpages\u001b[52Gin\u001b[55Gplace\u001b[61Gfirst.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B2\u001b[10G\u001b[1mint\u001b[14Gractive parts:\u001b[22m the forms (contact, newslett\u001b[58Gr\u001b[61Glogin), s\u001b[71Garch,\u001b[77Gand the land rates\u001b[96Gcalcula\u001b[104Gor.\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1BEach n\u001b[13Geds its own processing behind it, so each\u001b[55Gis a separate\u001b[69Gpiece\u001b[75Gof\u001b[78Gwork.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B3\u001b[6G\u001b[1mKiswahili:\u001b[22m add it last. A second\u001b[39Glangu\u001b[45Gge mean\u001b[53G translating every page\u001b[81Gel\u001b[84Gment,\u001b[90Gso it\u001b[96Gm\u001b[98Gkes sense\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bon\u001b[9Ge\u001b[11Gth\u001b[14G con\u001b[19Gent has settled.\u001b[36G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BShall I\u001b[11Gstart on the page \u001b[30Gre\u001b[33G as\u001b[37Ginitial\u001b[45Gcontent?\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GChurned for 7s · done 8:55 AM\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mIs there anything I could break, and can I undo it?\u001b[39m                                                     \r\u001b[2B\u001b[49m\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[31;1H\u001b[29;3H\u001b[?25h"]
