[145.27902, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3G \u001b[5Gcontent elements are layered on top.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mWhy as initial content in the package\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[22mYour commits are stages (\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mStage 00\u001b[39m to \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mStage 03\u001b[39m),\u001b[51Gso\u001b[54Gthis\u001b[59Glooks\u001b[65Glike\u001b[70Ga\u001b[72Gdemo\u001b[77Gthat\u001b[82Ghas\u001b[86Gto\u001b[89Gcome\u001b[94Gup\u001b[97Gthe\u001b[101Gsame\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bway on a fresh in\u001b[23Gll.\u001b[27GIf the pages\u001b[40Gexist only\u001b[51Gin\u001b[54Gyour\u001b[61Gcal\u001b[65Gdatab\u001b[71Gse, the next \u001b[85Gtage can't be rebuilt\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bfrom the\u001b[12Grepository. If\u001b[27Gthey ship a\u001b[40Gin\u001b[43Gtial content in\u001b[59G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mmtosafi_sitepackage\u001b[39m, a fresh install\u001b[96Gg\u001b[98Gts the\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bsame\u001b[8Gpage tree, la\u001b[22Gouts\u001b[27Gand setting\u001b[40Gevery time.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mAfter that, in this order\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[22m1. \u001b[1mThe \u001b[11Gome\u001b[15Gpage content elements:\u001b[38G\u001b[22mslider,\u001b[46Gservice\u001b[54Gtiles,\u001b[61Gnews\u001b[66Gand\u001b[70Gevents\u001b[77Gteasers.\u001b[86GThese\u001b[92Gare\u001b[96Gthe\u001b[100Gmost\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  \u001b[6Gvisible part of the design and need the\u001b[46Gpages in p\u001b[57Gace\u001b[61Gfir\u001b[65Gt.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B2.\u001b[6G\u001b[1mThe interactive parts:\u001b[22m the\u001b[33Gforms (contact, newsletter,\u001b[61Glogin),\u001b[69Gsearch,\u001b[77Gand\u001b[81Gthe\u001b[85Gland\u001b[90Grates\u001b[96Gcalculator.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  \u001b[6GEach needs its own processing behind it, so \u001b[51Gach is a separate\u001b[69Gpiece of work.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B3.\u001b[6G\u001b[1mKiswahili:\u001b[17G\u001b[22madd\u001b[21Git last. A second language means translating every page and element,\u001b[90Gso\u001b[93Git\u001b[96Gmakes\u001b[102Gsense\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  \u001b[6Gonce the content has settled.\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BShall\u001b[9GI\u001b[11Gstart\u001b[17Gon\u001b[20Gthe\u001b[24Gpage\u001b[29Gtree\u001b[34Gas\u001b[37Ginitial\u001b[45Gcontent?\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GChurned for 7s · done 8:55 AM\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mIs there anything I could break, and can I undo it?\u001b[39m                                                     \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mVery\u001b[8Glittle\u001b[15Gcan\u001b[19Gbreak,\u001b[26Gand\u001b[30Gall\u001b[34Gof\u001b[37Git\u001b[40Gcan\u001b[44Gbe\u001b[47Gundone,\u001b[55Gas\u001b[58Glong\u001b[63Gas\u001b[66Gwe\u001b[69Gtake\u001b[74Ga\u001b[76Gdatabase\u001b[85Gsnapshot\u001b[94Gfirst.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mWhat could go wrong\r\u001b[1B\u001b[22m \u001b[3G-\u001b[K\u001b[31;1H\u001b[29;3H\u001b[?25h"]
