[146.880276, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3Gs\u001b[5Gme page tree, layouts\u001b[27Gand s\u001b[33Gtting\u001b[41Gvery\u001b[46Gtime.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mAfter that, in this order\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B1.\u001b[6G\u001b[1mThe home page content elements:\u001b[38G\u001b[22mslider,\u001b[46Gservice\u001b[54Gtiles,\u001b[61Gnews\u001b[66Gand\u001b[70Gevents\u001b[77Gteasers.\u001b[86GThese\u001b[92Gare\u001b[96Gthe\u001b[100Gmost\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B   visible part of the design\u001b[33Gand\u001b[37Gneed\u001b[42Gthe\u001b[46Gpages\u001b[52Gin\u001b[55Gplace\u001b[61Gfirst.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B2\u001b[10G\u001b[1mint\u001b[14Gractive parts:\u001b[22m the forms (contact, newslett\u001b[58Gr\u001b[61Glogin), s\u001b[71Garch,\u001b[77Gand the land rates\u001b[96Gcalcula\u001b[104Gor.\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1BEach n\u001b[13Geds its own processing behind it, so each\u001b[55Gis a separate\u001b[69Gpiece\u001b[75Gof\u001b[78Gwork.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B3\u001b[6G\u001b[1mKiswahili:\u001b[22m add it last. A second\u001b[39Glangu\u001b[45Gge mean\u001b[53G translating every page\u001b[81Gel\u001b[84Gment,\u001b[90Gso it\u001b[96Gm\u001b[98Gkes sense\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bon\u001b[9Ge\u001b[11Gth\u001b[14G con\u001b[19Gent has settled.\u001b[36G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BShall I\u001b[11Gstart on the page \u001b[30Gre\u001b[33G as\u001b[37Ginitial\u001b[45Gcontent?\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GChurned for 7s · done 8:55 AM\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mIs there anything I could break, and can I undo it?\u001b[39m                                                     \r\u001b[2B\u001b[49m\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[39m Very little can break, and all of it can be undone, as long as we take a database snapshot first.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B \u001b[3G\u001b[1mWhat could go wrong\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[