[158.101507, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H  - \u001b[1mA second \"Home\" page.\u001b[22m Initial content is imported as a new page tree. The existing Home page (uid 1)\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gstays, so you'd see two root pages, and the si\u001b[53G would\u001b[60Gk\u001b[62Gep poin\u001b[70Ging at th\u001b[80G old one until its config\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bis changed.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mWrong page IDs.\u001b[21G\u001b[22mThe\u001b[25Gimport\u001b[32Ggives\u001b[38Gpages\u001b[44Gnew\u001b[48GIDs.\u001b[53GIf\u001b[56Gthe\u001b[60Gsettings\u001b[69G(service\u001b[78Gmenu,\u001b[84Gfooter\u001b[91Gmenu,\u001b[97Gsearch\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gpage) or the site's\u001b[25Groot pa\u001b[33Ge refer to\u001b[44Gfixed numbers, th\u001b[62Gy can point at th\u001b[80G wrong page or non\u001b[99G. T\u001b[103Ge\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bmenus\u001b[11Gwould then stay empty or link\u001b[44Gthe wrong place, but nothing would crash.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mThe import runs only once.\u001b[22m TYPO3 marks\u001b[48Ginitial content as imported. If I fix\u001b[86Gsomething\u001b[96Gin\u001b[99Git\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Glater, setting up the extension ag\u001b[40Gin won't re-\u001b[53Gmport it, so to tes\u001b[73G it\u001b[77Gagain we'd have to\u001b[96Grestore\u001b[104Gthe\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bd\u001b[8Gabase first.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mYour existing content:\u001b[28G\u001b[22mthere's\u001b[36Gonly\u001b[41Gthe\u001b[45Gone\u001b[49G\"Welcome\u001b[58Gto\u001b[61Gyour\u001b[66Gdefault\u001b[74Gwebsite\"\u001b[83Gelement,\u001b[92Gso\u001b[95Gthere's\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gnothing of value to lose.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BThe\u001b[7Gdesign\u001b[14Gfiles,\u001b[21Gthe\u001b[25Gtemplates\u001b[35Gand\u001b[39Gthe\u001b[43Gbackend\u001b[51Gstay\u001b[56Guntouched,\u001b[67Gand\u001b[71Gnothing\u001b[79Gleaves\u001b[86Gyour\u001b[91Gmachine.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001